FlowCRM AI Enterprise — End-to-End System Walkthrough & Integration Audit
📋 Executive Overview
FlowCRM AI Enterprise is a full-stack, enterprise-grade Customer Relationship Management (CRM) and Business Operations Platform built with modern web technologies:

Frontend Stack: React 19, TypeScript 6, Vite 8, TailwindCSS 3, Framer Motion 12 (Spring Physics & Micro-animations), Lucide Icons, Recharts, Zustand State Management, jsPDF.
Backend Stack: Express.js REST API, TypeScript, Prisma ORM 7, PostgreSQL Database, JWT Auth + HttpOnly Cookies, Winston Logger, Zod Validation, Custom RBAC Permission Middleware.
Security & Authorization: Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) with 164 granular system permissions mapped across 10 default enterprise roles (Super Admin, Admin, Sales Manager, Sales Executive, Team Lead, Marketing, Support, Finance, HR, Viewer).
This document presents a pinpoint end-to-end walkthrough of the entire application, auditing every module, page, API endpoint, routing status, database connection, and feature maturity state.

