💡 Production Deployment Checklist
To transition from local staging to a production environment:

Environment Configuration (.env):
Update DATABASE_URL with production PostgreSQL connection credentials (sslmode=require).
Set strong random strings for JWT_SECRET and COOKIE_SECRET.
Configure live SMTP credentials (SMTP_HOST, SMTP_PORT, SMTP_USER, SMTP_PASS) for real-world outbound emails.
Real-time WebSockets Integration (Optional Enhancement):
Live Chat and Notifications currently use high-resilience REST polling fallback. For sub-millisecond instant messaging, a Socket.io / WebSocket server layer can be bound to the existing Express HTTP instance.
Storage Bucket Integration:
Local document attachments currently store references in database. Connecting AWS S3 or Cloudflare R2 will enable scalable cloud media storage.
